WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.345
The baby Rocket Girl giggled and drooled.

2
00:00:06.346 --> 00:00:08.882
Vanda hurried outside.

3
00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:12.239
"Rocket Girl can't stop me now.

4
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.038
I'll go out and steal more money!"

5
00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:19.952
Baby Roxy shivered in the cold mist.

6
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:26.425
She began to cry.

7
00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.191
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

8
00:00:29.192 --> 00:00:32.503
Her heat vision warmed up the mist.

9
00:00:32.504 --> 00:00:34.603
Suddenly Roxy grew.

10
00:00:34.604 --> 00:00:37.194
She was an eight-year-old again!

11
00:00:37.195 --> 00:00:39.899
"Wow!" Roxy said.

12
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.292
"Vanda's treatment only works if it's cold!"

13
00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:45.728
She looked around the spa.

14
00:00:45.729 --> 00:00:53.717
"I have to find Vanda and stop her from stealing."

15
00:00:53.718 --> 00:01:00.096
She used her heat vision to warm up the tank.

16
00:01:00.097 --> 00:01:04.098
Then she picked it up and flew off.

17
00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:09.106
As she flew, she sprayed the warm mist over the city.

18
00:01:09.107 --> 00:01:13.370
Down on the streets, babies slowly turned back into adults.

19
00:01:13.371 --> 00:01:18.051
Roxy was flying over her own neighborhood when she heard Mara.

20
00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:23.390
"Rocket Girl!" Mara cried. "I need help!"

21
00:01:23.391 --> 00:01:27.400
Roxy landed and saw Mara with a toddler and a baby.

22
00:01:27.401 --> 00:01:30.872
"I'm so glad I saw you," Mara said.

23
00:01:30.873 --> 00:01:34.567
"I'm supposed to be a mother's helper for Mrs. Garson.

24
00:01:34.568 --> 00:01:36.546
But I can't find her.

25
00:01:36.547 --> 00:01:40.897
Her two-year-old is here, and so is this mystery baby!

26
00:01:40.898 --> 00:01:46.343
What should I do?"

27
00:01:46.344 --> 00:01:49.247
Roxy sprayed the baby with the warm mist.

28
00:01:49.248 --> 00:01:52.351
The baby turned into a grown woman.

29
00:01:52.352 --> 00:01:55.880
"Mrs. Garson!" Mara cried.

30
00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:58.293
Mrs. Garson looked confused.

31
00:01:58.294 --> 00:02:00.647
"What happened to me?"

32
00:02:00.648 --> 00:02:05.777
"Don't worry, Mrs. Garson," Roxy said. "You're fine now!"

33
00:02:05.778 --> 00:02:07.940
Roxy took off again.

34
00:02:07.941 --> 00:02:11.239
She turned more babies back into adults.

35
00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:15.105
Then her super ears heard an alarm going off across town.

36
00:02:15.106 --> 00:02:18.541
Roxy flew toward the sound.

37
00:02:18.542 --> 00:02:23.290
Vanda was running out of a bank with bags of money.

38
00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:26.804
Roxy used her super breath to cool down the tank.

39
00:02:26.805 --> 00:02:29.959
She swooped at Vanda.

40
00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.588
She sprayed cold mist.

41
00:02:32.589 --> 00:02:39.007
Vanda grew small. "Goo-goo, ga-ga!"

42
00:02:39.008 --> 00:02:43.440
Roxy scooped up the baby Vanda and flew off.

43
00:02:43.441 --> 00:02:48.001
Terrell and Jack were playing soccer.

44
00:02:48.002 --> 00:02:51.584
"I see Rocket Girl!" Terrell said.

45
00:02:51.585 --> 00:02:56.493
Jack gasped. "She's carrying a baby!"

46
00:02:56.494 --> 00:03:00.964
Back at Metro City Plumbing Supply, Roxy heated up the tank again.

47
00:03:00.965 --> 00:03:04.760
Then she sprayed the Detective Smith and Mr. Copper babies.

48
00:03:04.761 --> 00:03:07.293
They turned back into adults.

49
00:03:07.294 --> 00:03:10.613
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith said.

50
00:03:10.614 --> 00:03:13.552
"Being a baby was terrible!"

51
00:03:13.553 --> 00:03:16.220
Roxy handed him the baby Vanda.

52
00:03:16.221 --> 00:03:23.396
"You can take this baby to jail, Detective!"

53
00:03:23.397 --> 00:03:26.924
That evening Roxy and her friends were playing a board game.

54
00:03:26.925 --> 00:03:30.346
"How was your job, Mara?" Roxy asked.

55
00:03:30.347 --> 00:03:35.212
"It was great," Mara said. "I saw Rocket Girl!"

56
00:03:35.213 --> 00:03:38.474
"Wow!" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

57
00:03:38.475 --> 00:03:44.021
"I saw her too," Terrell said. "She was babysitting."

58
00:03:44.022 --> 00:03:48.124
"Really?" Roxy shrugged. "That's odd."

59
00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:50.654
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

60
00:03:50.655 --> 00:03:55.975
"Yes, it was very odd."

